PERMISOS NECESARIOS EN PRODUCCION

Carpetas que deben poder escribir PHP/Apache:

sunat                  775 www-data:www-data
sunat/comprobantes     775 www-data:www-data
sunat/resumenes        775 www-data:www-data
sunat/webphuyu         775 www-data:www-data
application/logs       775 www-data:www-data
application/cache      775 www-data:www-data
public/img/empresa     2775 www-data:www-data

Comandos para corregir permisos:

sudo chown -R www-data:www-data sunat application/logs application/cache public/img/empresa
sudo find sunat application/logs application/cache public/img/empresa -type d -exec chmod 775 {} \;
sudo find sunat application/logs application/cache public/img/empresa -type f -exec chmod 664 {} \;
sudo chmod 2775 public/img/empresa

Comandos para verificar:

stat -c '%A %a %U:%G %n' sunat sunat/comprobantes sunat/resumenes sunat/webphuyu application/logs application/cache public/img/empresa
sudo -u www-data sh -c 'touch sunat/.perm_test && rm sunat/.perm_test'
sudo -u www-data sh -c 'touch public/img/empresa/.perm_test && rm public/img/empresa/.perm_test'

Composer con PHP 7.4:

/usr/bin/php7.4 $(which composer) install
/usr/bin/php7.4 $(which composer) dump-autoload -o
